{
  "title": "Suffix IT Limited : Software Company in Bangladesh",
  "text": "Home\nAbout\nProducts\nIoT\nServices\nCareer\nContact\nData Center Power & Cooling Built for Reliability and Efficiency\nHomeData Center Power & Cooling Built for Reliability and Efficiency\nEnsuring Uninterrupted Performance and Reliability\n\nIn today’s digital landscape, data centers are the backbone of business operations, housing critical infrastructure and sensitive data. Ensuring optimal power and cooling is essential to maintaining the reliability, efficiency, and performance of your data center. At Suffix IT Limited, we specialize in providing top-tier power and cooling solutions designed to maximize uptime, minimize operational costs, and enhance energy efficiency.\n\nOur Power & Cooling Solutions\nFuture-Proof Your Data Center Today\nGet a Free Consultation\nOur Commitment To Your Success\n\nSolutions That Grow With Your Vision And Goals\n\nExpertise\n\nOur team comprises seasoned professionals with extensive experience in IT infrastructure services.\n\nCustomized Solutions\n\nWe tailor our services to meet the unique requirements of your business.\n\nProactive Approach\n\nWe emphasize proactive monitoring and maintenance to prevent issues before they arise.\n\nClient-Centric Focus\n\nYour business success is our priority; we work closely with you to achieve your IT goals.\n\nWe maintain strategic partnerships with multiple organizations in Bangladesh and worldwide, working together to deliver high-quality solutions and long-term value.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nCha-70,70/A, Rupayan Millennium Square (9A), Progoti Sharoni, North Badda, Gulshan, Dhaka-1212.\n\ninfo@suffixit.com\n\n+88 01958 424000\n\nQUICK LINKS\nAbout Us\nCareer\nContact Us\n\n© 2026 All Rights Reserved by Suffix IT Limited",
